# The image carries CODE. Ledgers live on the Railway volume at /app/state;
# the laptop's 1.3 GB of state must never be baked into an image (a stale
# copy of a ledger that then gets shadowed by an empty volume is two ways to
# be wrong at once).
state/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.env
.env.*
